WEBVTT

00:00:10.210 --> 00:00:12.680
So this is your despair?

00:00:12.680 --> 00:00:14.910
Master Kaoru.

00:00:14.910 --> 00:00:17.510
You... It can't be.

00:00:17.850 --> 00:00:21.050
That's right, it's me, Kaoru.

00:00:22.220 --> 00:00:23.320
Jasei.

00:00:28.520 --> 00:00:31.830
I've finally tasted your despair.

00:00:31.830 --> 00:00:33.730
How delicious.

00:00:33.730 --> 00:00:37.100
This is it.
This is what I've been waiting for.

00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:40.640
Why are you...

00:00:41.970 --> 00:00:46.540
I made you think I was dead, and possessed another human.

00:00:46.540 --> 00:00:51.410
A mage that you would surely one day join forces with.

00:00:52.480 --> 00:00:55.550
Then, you knew about everything?

00:00:55.550 --> 00:01:00.860
Everything went according to the causality of my curse.

00:01:00.860 --> 00:01:05.230
After my death, I knew you would look for a way to erase my spell.

00:01:05.230 --> 00:01:09.230
You would search for the strongest mage of the time,

00:01:09.230 --> 00:01:12.500
and come across
Sekidousai and join him.

00:01:12.500 --> 00:01:18.140
But I knew you would definitely fight Sekidousai.

00:01:19.410 --> 00:01:24.980
I waited inside Sekidousai for that exact moment.

00:01:24.980 --> 00:01:30.320
The moment when you're betrayed by a loved one and in despair.

00:01:30.320 --> 00:01:33.460
You did exactly as I planned.

00:01:33.460 --> 00:01:36.060
Thanks to that, I gained your despair.

00:01:36.060 --> 00:01:38.760
I'm thankful, Kaoru Kawahira.

00:01:42.060 --> 00:01:45.000
Master Kaoru. I'm...

00:01:45.800 --> 00:01:48.040
I'm sorry, Nadeshiko.

00:01:48.670 --> 00:01:51.470
I couldn't answer your feelings.

00:01:51.470 --> 00:01:54.510
No, it's my fault.

00:01:54.510 --> 00:01:57.650
If only I had followed your orders.

00:01:57.880 --> 00:01:59.850
I'm...

00:02:00.480 --> 00:02:04.050
It's all right. There's still hope.

00:02:04.490 --> 00:02:07.760
I'm sure Keita will do something.

00:02:09.060 --> 00:02:11.930
He's my last hope.

00:02:12.430 --> 00:02:13.630
I...

00:02:14.260 --> 00:02:17.370
I always wanted to be like Keita.

00:02:17.770 --> 00:02:20.100
That's right...

00:02:20.100 --> 00:02:21.840
Ever since we first met,

00:02:22.240 --> 00:02:26.310
he was always so energetic and reckless.

00:02:26.640 --> 00:02:30.080
But I looked up to him.

00:02:31.510 --> 00:02:33.920
As I was hiding a secret,

00:02:33.920 --> 00:02:36.420
he was a bright light for me.

00:02:38.920 --> 00:02:42.260
I'm sure he would save me.

00:02:43.360 --> 00:02:46.030
That's enough.
Please don't speak anymore.

00:02:50.270 --> 00:02:53.440
I love you, Nadeshiko.

00:02:57.710 --> 00:02:59.610
Master Kaoru.

00:03:05.180 --> 00:03:08.850
No.

00:03:08.850 --> 00:03:12.990
Master Kaoru!

00:03:18.760 --> 00:03:22.460
<i>Can I keep on praying?</i>

00:03:22.460 --> 00:03:25.770
<i>Can I keep on believing?</i>

00:03:25.770 --> 00:03:32.740
<i>Oh light that shines</i> <i>in the forest of despair</i>

00:03:43.350 --> 00:03:49.230
<i>I kick the cold ground with my toes</i>

00:03:49.960 --> 00:03:56.300
<i>My brushed hair dances</i> <i>in the moonlit night</i>

00:03:56.700 --> 00:04:02.910
<i>Let's throw away your</i> <i>frightened eyes and loneliness</i>

00:04:03.370 --> 00:04:10.650
<i>Those days when acting tough</i> <i>was your only friend...</i>

00:04:10.650 --> 00:04:15.450
<i>Leave that in the distance</i>

00:04:15.450 --> 00:04:19.190
<i>Is my salvation over there?</i>

00:04:19.190 --> 00:04:22.460
<i>Can I heal this deep darkness?</i>

00:04:22.460 --> 00:04:28.230
<i>Is it okay for me to seek warmth?</i>

00:04:28.800 --> 00:04:32.570
<i>I want to be stronger</i> <i>than anyone else</i>

00:04:32.570 --> 00:04:35.840
<i>I want to protect my loved ones</i>

00:04:35.840 --> 00:04:41.980
<i>Oh light that continues</i> <i>to shine on me</i>

00:04:45.080 --> 00:04:47.050
"Banquet of Despair!"

00:04:49.690 --> 00:04:51.390
Karina, did you feel it?

00:04:51.750 --> 00:04:53.060
Yeah.

00:04:53.060 --> 00:04:56.690
An evil power appeared and a different power disappeared.

00:04:56.690 --> 00:04:57.730
It has to be...

00:04:58.060 --> 00:05:00.130
Yeah, Kaoru.

00:05:00.130 --> 00:05:02.460
Darn. Hurry up, Karina.

00:05:02.460 --> 00:05:03.500
Okay.

00:05:10.240 --> 00:05:12.710
And more despair.

00:05:13.610 --> 00:05:16.650
This area is flowing with despair.

00:05:21.480 --> 00:05:22.850
Master Kaoru.

00:05:22.850 --> 00:05:24.250
No.

00:05:24.250 --> 00:05:25.320
Why?

00:05:26.590 --> 00:05:28.920
Master Kaoru, that's a harsh joke.

00:05:28.920 --> 00:05:31.530
That's right, I can't laugh at this.

00:05:31.530 --> 00:05:33.130
Master Kaoru.

00:05:35.160 --> 00:05:38.500
Such sweet sounds that adorn despair.

00:05:38.500 --> 00:05:41.100
Cry with your deep sadness.

00:05:41.100 --> 00:05:42.910
Scream!

00:05:49.910 --> 00:05:51.580
It's not over yet.

00:05:53.450 --> 00:05:54.450
Tensou?

00:05:54.450 --> 00:05:58.120
Master Kaoru would never give up. That's why...

00:05:58.790 --> 00:06:00.060
I won't either.

00:06:01.860 --> 00:06:04.860
You're right.
Master Kaoru never gave up.

00:06:05.630 --> 00:06:09.130
He fought his fate until the end.

00:06:16.610 --> 00:06:18.670
Everyone, get a hold of yourself.

00:06:18.670 --> 00:06:21.040
Is that how
Master Kaoru's Inukami act?

00:06:21.640 --> 00:06:23.350
We still have a plan.

00:06:23.350 --> 00:06:25.380
If we use Daisakkai's power...

00:06:26.250 --> 00:06:29.390
I see. If we use that, we can defeat him.

00:06:29.390 --> 00:06:31.450
And bring back Master Kaoru.

00:06:33.360 --> 00:06:34.460
Let's go!

00:06:36.020 --> 00:06:37.430
Oh wow.

00:06:38.630 --> 00:06:42.360
Well, not enough for you to have despair?

00:06:42.360 --> 00:06:45.430
Such master-loving Inukami. Then...

00:06:51.370 --> 00:06:52.710
I'm flying.

00:06:52.710 --> 00:06:56.250
From now on,
I'm your master. Be quiet.

00:06:56.750 --> 00:06:58.750
I'll be taking Daisakkai.

00:06:58.750 --> 00:06:59.750
Teleport.

00:07:03.720 --> 00:07:06.820
Do you think your meager technique would work?

00:07:08.660 --> 00:07:11.530
Now, dear Inukami girls.

00:07:11.530 --> 00:07:14.700
Come here if you want Daisakkai.

00:07:14.700 --> 00:07:17.100
I will give you a warm welcome.

00:07:25.370 --> 00:07:26.740
Spread out.

00:07:26.740 --> 00:07:30.010
It's fine as long as one of us reaches Daisakkai.

00:07:30.010 --> 00:07:31.110
Understood.

00:07:31.880 --> 00:07:34.280
Master Kaoru, I will do my best.

00:07:35.420 --> 00:07:37.790
I won't give up till the end.

00:07:38.420 --> 00:07:42.260
Master Kaoru forgave us when we doubted him.

00:07:42.260 --> 00:07:44.460
We must return his kindness...

00:07:45.260 --> 00:07:47.630
Or we're failures as Inukami.

00:07:48.560 --> 00:07:53.300
He taught us about the courage to fight and a righteous heart.

00:07:53.670 --> 00:07:57.140
This time we will fight for him.

00:07:58.870 --> 00:08:01.340
Master Kaoru, please wait.

00:08:01.340 --> 00:08:04.250
Even if I lose my life,
I will save you.

00:08:08.650 --> 00:08:12.320
Will you make it?

00:08:15.690 --> 00:08:16.530
Skeletons?

00:08:21.660 --> 00:08:23.430
Get out of our way!

00:08:23.430 --> 00:08:25.570
We don't have any time to play around.

00:08:28.440 --> 00:08:29.510
Sayoka!

00:08:30.370 --> 00:08:31.910
Out of our way.

00:08:35.180 --> 00:08:37.750
Lightning, come.

00:08:42.120 --> 00:08:43.290
Igusa!

00:08:44.550 --> 00:08:46.090
Why did you do that?

00:08:46.090 --> 00:08:49.290
My strength will not be enough.

00:08:50.160 --> 00:08:52.730
But you surely could, Tayune.

00:09:08.180 --> 00:09:11.780
Quite the power, but you're full of openings.

00:09:18.520 --> 00:09:19.890
Purification Barrier

00:09:19.890 --> 00:09:22.890
Leave this place to me.
Hurry up and go.

00:09:22.890 --> 00:09:23.590
Tensou?

00:09:24.060 --> 00:09:27.630
It's fine, I'll catch up soon. Hurry.

00:09:42.580 --> 00:09:44.410
Gokyoya, Furano.

00:09:45.550 --> 00:09:46.850
We came back.

00:09:46.850 --> 00:09:48.620
If we're going, we go together.

00:09:57.030 --> 00:09:58.860
That's a nice expression.

00:09:58.860 --> 00:10:02.700
What despair will you show seeing your friends suffer?

00:10:05.600 --> 00:10:07.640
There's no end to this.

00:10:11.510 --> 00:10:12.810
Tomohane.

00:10:13.980 --> 00:10:15.110
Oh no.

00:10:15.580 --> 00:10:16.910
Evil Fire.

00:10:18.410 --> 00:10:19.680
Yoko.

00:10:19.680 --> 00:10:21.280
Hurry up and go.

00:10:21.280 --> 00:10:23.590
Otherwise I'll take the spotlight.

00:10:25.220 --> 00:10:26.620
Geez.

00:10:30.460 --> 00:10:33.260
If we wish using that, we can defeat Jasei.

00:10:33.260 --> 00:10:35.430
And we can bring Master Kaoru back.

00:10:35.430 --> 00:10:39.500
That's right. It's your only hope.

00:10:39.500 --> 00:10:44.840
But, those wishes shall never be granted.

00:10:48.610 --> 00:10:52.080
Let's turn your only hope into despair.

00:10:59.190 --> 00:11:01.860
I'm so sorry, Master Kaoru.

00:11:02.820 --> 00:11:03.890
I'm...

00:11:10.500 --> 00:11:11.630
Oh?

00:11:13.670 --> 00:11:18.370
Hammer of destruction, the power to destroy everything.

00:11:18.370 --> 00:11:21.940
Once again, I wish for one thing.

00:11:26.550 --> 00:11:27.720
Nadeshiko.

00:11:46.170 --> 00:11:48.740
I'm sorry, everyone.

00:11:50.270 --> 00:11:53.140
I did something I can't take back.

00:11:53.910 --> 00:11:56.980
That's why, I'll die after this.

00:11:56.980 --> 00:12:00.050
There's no more reason for me to live.

00:12:00.320 --> 00:12:03.450
But I will make sure to kill you.

00:12:03.850 --> 00:12:05.920
There's no point in letting you live.

00:12:06.690 --> 00:12:07.660
Kill?

00:12:07.660 --> 00:12:11.160
A mere Inukami like you is trying to kill me?

00:12:15.000 --> 00:12:19.170
Evil Blaze and Blood of Sekidou, come.

00:12:36.550 --> 00:12:38.490
Then let's begin.

00:12:39.020 --> 00:12:43.660
The unforgivable dance of death between sinful ones.

00:12:48.100 --> 00:12:49.200
"Inukami!"

00:12:49.500 --> 00:12:51.000
Woof woof.

00:12:57.170 --> 00:12:58.340
I won't kill you yet.

00:13:01.780 --> 00:13:03.680
Lightning, come.

00:13:12.550 --> 00:13:14.860
The pain you inflicted...

00:13:15.460 --> 00:13:17.330
is more than this.

00:13:22.700 --> 00:13:26.400
What's with that power?

00:13:26.400 --> 00:13:27.940
Who are you?

00:13:28.340 --> 00:13:30.710
I'm a sinful existence.

00:13:30.710 --> 00:13:34.910
I was drunk with fighting and nearly destroyed a human village.

00:13:35.440 --> 00:13:38.810
That's why I swore
I would never fight again.

00:13:38.810 --> 00:13:40.920
I gave my power to the heavens.

00:13:41.750 --> 00:13:46.020
She's afraid of her own power and she hated herself.

00:13:46.590 --> 00:13:49.390
She became masterless and stopped fighting.

00:13:49.390 --> 00:13:52.290
That's where her "reluctant" nickname came from.

00:13:52.290 --> 00:13:54.500
Then, that's Nadeshiko's...

00:13:54.860 --> 00:13:58.170
Yes, her true full power.

00:13:58.670 --> 00:14:01.670
Once she's like that, there's no stopping her.

00:14:02.070 --> 00:14:04.570
To fulfill your greed of living...

00:14:05.010 --> 00:14:07.310
Just for such a thing.

00:14:08.110 --> 00:14:11.180
You played around with Master Kaoru's fate.

00:14:11.180 --> 00:14:15.380
Master Kaoru's pain and suffering is more than this.

00:14:15.380 --> 00:14:17.520
I won't let you die easily.

00:14:17.520 --> 00:14:19.590
I will make you suffer.

00:14:19.590 --> 00:14:22.920
I'll erase your existence without a single speck left.

00:14:38.970 --> 00:14:40.410
Nadeshiko.

00:14:41.680 --> 00:14:45.850
Are you going to kill me again?

00:14:49.520 --> 00:14:52.320
Causality, bow down before me.

00:14:58.130 --> 00:15:00.260
Such a foolish girl.

00:15:00.530 --> 00:15:05.300
If I turn back time until before you gained that power.

00:15:05.300 --> 00:15:07.770
What will happen?

00:15:09.140 --> 00:15:12.970
No.

00:15:29.360 --> 00:15:33.130
How's that? To be trampled by a power you can't fight against.

00:15:33.130 --> 00:15:36.400
How does it feel when your life is being toyed with?

00:15:39.300 --> 00:15:42.500
That's it. That's despair.

00:15:42.500 --> 00:15:45.770
Not a single hope, not a single light.

00:15:45.770 --> 00:15:49.080
All you can see is a darkness called death.

00:15:49.080 --> 00:15:52.650
This is it. This is what I wanted.

00:16:03.630 --> 00:16:04.830
Nadeshiko.

00:16:07.160 --> 00:16:09.160
Everyone, let's go.

00:16:09.160 --> 00:16:11.530
It's not over yet.

00:16:12.270 --> 00:16:15.540
You're right. We can still fight.

00:16:16.040 --> 00:16:18.070
We have to do it.

00:16:18.070 --> 00:16:19.980
Or Master Kaoru will get mad.

00:16:26.550 --> 00:16:29.520
You're still going to go at it, Inukami?

00:16:31.190 --> 00:16:34.560
We're Kaoru Kawahira's Inukami.

00:16:34.560 --> 00:16:35.820
We shall be your opponent.

00:16:44.500 --> 00:16:47.470
Kawahira, what's that power we just felt?

00:16:47.470 --> 00:16:48.600
I don't know.

00:16:48.600 --> 00:16:52.770
But the fact it immediately disappeared means nothing's changed.

00:16:53.480 --> 00:16:55.980
What? Want to pee?
I can't breast feed you.

00:16:55.980 --> 00:16:58.250
Well, too bad. Hey, look.

00:17:00.920 --> 00:17:01.820
What's that?

00:17:01.820 --> 00:17:05.450
I don't know who you are, but I won't hold back if you're in my way.

00:17:05.450 --> 00:17:06.760
Angel Blade.

00:17:07.260 --> 00:17:10.430
Spiritual Investigator
Shiro Karina, onward.

00:17:14.130 --> 00:17:15.800
What are you doing?

00:17:17.970 --> 00:17:19.800
Stand up.

00:17:21.040 --> 00:17:22.040
It's enough.

00:17:23.240 --> 00:17:26.040
It's enough. Leave me alone.

00:17:30.080 --> 00:17:31.150
Yoko.

00:17:31.450 --> 00:17:35.620
You're going to give up by yourself?
I definitely won't forgive that.

00:17:35.980 --> 00:17:37.190
Look.

00:17:38.220 --> 00:17:39.520
Crimson.

00:17:40.990 --> 00:17:42.760
Insolent fools.

00:17:45.760 --> 00:17:47.760
Lightning, come.

00:17:50.670 --> 00:17:52.370
Is that it?

00:17:52.370 --> 00:17:54.470
Come again, more desperately.

00:17:54.470 --> 00:17:57.970
And rot in the depths of despair.

00:18:02.810 --> 00:18:07.780
They're carrying Kaoru's will fighting that monster-like opponent.

00:18:07.780 --> 00:18:11.690
And you would give up from losing your power?

00:18:11.690 --> 00:18:13.560
You love Kaoru, right?

00:18:13.560 --> 00:18:15.520
Then fight to the end.

00:18:15.520 --> 00:18:18.530
But, I have no right to fight.

00:18:18.530 --> 00:18:20.600
You understand too, right?

00:18:20.600 --> 00:18:24.830
Just say it.
Master Kaoru died because of me.

00:18:24.830 --> 00:18:27.340
I'm the one who killed Master Kaoru.

00:18:27.640 --> 00:18:29.740
Who's judging you?

00:18:29.740 --> 00:18:32.240
Everyone knows how you feel.

00:18:32.710 --> 00:18:34.580
That's why they won't judge you.

00:18:36.710 --> 00:18:38.610
I'm the same too.

00:18:38.610 --> 00:18:41.080
I want to have my loved one to myself.

00:18:41.520 --> 00:18:44.090
Every girl thinks so.

00:18:50.830 --> 00:18:54.160
Actually, you all are weird to begin with.

00:18:54.160 --> 00:18:57.500
10 girls following just one guy.

00:18:57.500 --> 00:19:01.640
If you really love him, you'll have to hog him just like me.

00:19:03.240 --> 00:19:06.370
Now then, seems like they're having trouble.

00:19:06.370 --> 00:19:07.910
I've got to go.

00:19:07.910 --> 00:19:09.140
Yoko.

00:19:09.440 --> 00:19:11.710
Jasei has an incredible power.

00:19:11.710 --> 00:19:16.350
Even if we combine our strength, there's little chance for us to win.

00:19:16.350 --> 00:19:18.650
And yet, why are you going?

00:19:19.590 --> 00:19:21.260
Isn't that obvious?

00:19:22.760 --> 00:19:23.860
Because I have Keita.

00:19:29.330 --> 00:19:31.030
Slash. Slash.

00:19:31.030 --> 00:19:31.970
Out of the way!

00:19:34.940 --> 00:19:35.840
Karina.

00:19:39.040 --> 00:19:41.580
Special move, Holy Crush.

00:19:44.450 --> 00:19:45.550
Oh, no!

00:19:48.650 --> 00:19:51.820
Kawahira. Kawahira.

00:19:53.690 --> 00:19:54.960
Yoko.

00:19:55.190 --> 00:19:56.390
Evil Blaze!

00:19:57.660 --> 00:20:00.860
Do you think you can win against your father's technique?

00:20:00.860 --> 00:20:02.260
Evil Blaze.

00:20:06.170 --> 00:20:07.440
Yoko.

00:20:07.440 --> 00:20:08.470
Purification Flash.

00:20:08.800 --> 00:20:11.870
Manifestation x9. Purgatory.

00:20:15.580 --> 00:20:16.880
We did it.

00:20:19.850 --> 00:20:21.750
Too bad.

00:20:21.750 --> 00:20:23.650
Now it's my turn.

00:20:23.650 --> 00:20:25.890
Grand Lightning.

00:20:32.830 --> 00:20:35.260
What's wrong, Inukami?

00:20:35.260 --> 00:20:37.930
It's still too early to despair.

00:20:37.930 --> 00:20:40.200
Let's play a bit more.

00:20:40.200 --> 00:20:45.840
Show me true despair, which shall become my food.

00:20:47.240 --> 00:20:50.040
Neither Evil Blaze nor Purgatory work.

00:20:50.040 --> 00:20:51.750
What should we do?

00:20:58.990 --> 00:21:03.260
Now, let's have our last dance.

00:21:06.690 --> 00:21:08.260
Keita.

00:21:13.870 --> 00:21:16.140
What is this place?

00:21:19.510 --> 00:21:24.480
No! Yoko!

00:21:38.060 --> 00:21:43.300
<i>This and that, we want everything</i>

00:21:43.300 --> 00:21:48.470
<i>We wish for love and that all</i> <i>of our dreams will come true</i>

00:21:48.470 --> 00:21:53.710
<i>Every girl is busy</i>

00:21:53.710 --> 00:21:58.880
<i>Playing, studying, going crazy</i>
<i>Our schedules are filled</i>

00:21:59.450 --> 00:22:02.020
<i>When we are about to be dumped,</i>

00:22:02.020 --> 00:22:04.690
<i>we send texts and gather</i>

00:22:04.690 --> 00:22:07.360
<i>A meeting at a family restaurant,</i>

00:22:07.360 --> 00:22:10.830
<i>and nothing makes any sense</i>

00:22:11.160 --> 00:22:13.730
<i>Oh, no. Oh, no. Oh, no</i>

00:22:13.730 --> 00:22:16.400
<i>We eat some sweets while we chat</i>

00:22:16.400 --> 00:22:21.670
<i>We can't stop, and now</i> <i>our diets are doomed too</i>

00:22:21.670 --> 00:22:24.110
